   <!-- 교수 검색 조건을 담은 SQL 프래그먼트 정의 -->


   <!-- 교수 총 레코드 수를 반환하는 쿼리 (selectTotalRecordProfessor) -->
   <select id="selectTotalRecordProfessor" resultType="int"
      parameterType="kr.or.ddit.common.paging.PaginationInfo">
      SELECT COUNT(*)
      FROM PROFESSOR
      <include refid="searchFrag2" />
   </select>

   <!-- 교수 리스트를 반환하는 쿼리(selectProfessorList) -->
   <select id="selectProfessorList" resultType="ProfessorVO"
      parameterType="kr.or.ddit.common.paging.PaginationInfo">
      SELECT B.*
      FROM(
      SELECT ROWNUM RNUM, A.*
      FROM(
      SELECT PRO_NO, PRO_NAME,
      PRO_MAJOR, PRO_TELNO
      FROM PROFESSOR
      <include refid="searchFrag2" />
      ORDER BY PRO_NO DESC
      ) A
      ORDER BY
      PRO_NO
      ) B
      <![CDATA[
      WHERE RNUM >= #{startRow} AND RNUM <= #{endRow}
      ]]>
   </select>

   <!-- 교수 정보 조회 (selectProfessor) -->
   <select id="selectProfessor" resultType="ProfessorVO"
      parameterType="string">
      SELECT PRO_NO, PRO_NAME,
      PRO_MAJOR, PRO_TELNO
      FROM
      PROFESSOR
      WHERE PRO_NO = #{proNo}
   </select>
